<title>USA: Imation sees $12 mln Q4 write-off.</title>
<headline>Imation sees $12 mln Q4 write-off.</headline>
<dateline>OAKDALE, Minn. 1996-10-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Imation Corp said on Wednesday it expects to absorb a $12 million after-tax write-off in the 1996 fourth quarter.</p>
<p>Imation said the write-off will be for in-process research and development of Luminous Corp, which was acquired in October.</p>
